      "title": "Aofi Harbour Bathymetry 2013 1m",
      "description": "This data set is an output of a study which goal is to work with the Ministry of Agriculture Forests and Fisheries of Niue to assess foreshore options for harbour expansion and development of the existing infrastructure. The objectives of the study are to provide the Government of the Niue with advice, assistance and technical expertise towards further harbour infrastructure development:Make recommendations on for the planned infrastructure, based upon geological and geophysical investigations. [Source: This metadata record was automatically extracted from the GeoNode portal pacificdata]",
